t.card(t.wo['performance_tasks'][2],'04 05',cases+' Evaluate expansion in Case 1 (7). Evaluate expansion in Case 2 (7).','Case 1: net unit cost falls N$2, sustained demand supports utilisation and affordable capital supports feasibility. Expansion is plausible while organisation and sales conditions hold, though lower unit cost alone does not measure total profit. Case 2: unit cost rises N$1, demand is narrow and capital is unsecured. Retaining a smaller scale is better supported until coordination, buyers and funding improve; potential technical savings alone do not settle the choice.',['Case 1 marks (7): argument for net N$2 saving (1), stable market/capital support (1); argument against organisational risk (1), profit not established by unit cost alone (1); condition sustained utilisation and feasibility (1); judgement expand plausible (1), linked to balance and constraints (1). Case 2 allocation (7): argument for potential N$3 savings (1), organisation might be repaired (1); argument against net N$1 increase (1), narrow demand/unsecured finance (1); condition constraints addressed (1); judgement remain smaller for now (1), tied to current evidence (1). Total 14.'],[cases])
